# {{projectName}}

A Solana/SVM blockchain agent built with [SAISO](https://github.com/bhiktor/saiso) using the **SVM MCP Server** for high-throughput agentic execution.

## 🌐 SVM Server Features

This agent uses the first-party SVM MCP server (`@saiso/svm-mcp-server`), which provides:

- **🌍 Cluster Support**: Solana Mainnet, Testnet, and Devnet
- **🛠️ Comprehensive Tools**: balance checks, transfers, program interactions, transaction simulation
- **🎯 Advanced Features**: SPL tokens, account/program state access, fast confirmations
- **🔒 Production Ready**: designed for agentic transaction flows

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites

- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) (v18 or higher)
- [Bun](https://bun.sh/) (recommended) or npm

### Installation

```bash
# Install dependencies
bun install

# Copy environment configuration
cp .env.example .env

# Edit your environment variables
nano .env
```

### Configuration

Set your private key and other configuration in the `.env` file:

```bash
# Required: Your private key
PRIVATE_KEY=your_private_key_here

# Network (automatically configured for {{targetNetwork}})
NETWORK={{targetNetwork}}
RPC_URL={{rpcUrl}}
CHAIN_ID={{chainId}}

# Agent settings
AGENT_NAME={{agentName}}
LOG_LEVEL=info
```

### Running the Agent

```bash
# Development mode (auto-restart on changes)
bun run dev

# Production mode
bun run start
```

